276
01:14:20.090 --> 01:14:22.090
It's such a great group, isn't it?

277
01:14:23.090 --> 01:14:25.090
You will absolutely not regret it.

278
01:14:30.090 --> 01:14:32.090
You can push even harder.

279
01:14:35.090 --> 01:14:40.090
