293
01:16:22.090 --> 01:16:29.090
And then He says yes, persecution will come for the disciples who live for my righteousness.

294
01:16:32.090 --> 01:16:35.090
And He wants us to have a reference frame for that.

295
01:16:36.090 --> 01:16:40.090
And He wants us to have a reference frame for that.

296
01:16:47.090 --> 01:16:53.090
He wants us to realize that if we truly live for what He stands for in this world.

297
01:16:56.090 --> 01:16:59.090
