303
01:17:38.090 --> 01:17:40.090
They did not love Jesus.

304
01:17:41.090 --> 01:17:42.090
They crucified Him.

305
01:17:45.090 --> 01:17:47.090
The world did not love Him.

306
01:17:48.090 --> 01:17:49.090
Not entirely.

307
01:17:50.090 --> 01:17:52.090
