337
01:21:04.090 --> 01:21:05.090
Broccoli, yes.

338
01:21:09.090 --> 01:21:10.090
This is a vegetable.

339
01:21:13.090 --> 01:21:16.090
This is such an ugly vegetable that you actually don't want to eat it.

340
01:21:19.090 --> 01:21:21.090
And you let it sit on the edge of your plate.

341
01:21:23.090 --> 01:21:26.090
And then you say, look mom, I have eaten the rest.

342
01:21:28.090 --> 01:21:30.090
Then you just pour a lot of sauce on it.

343
01:21:33.090 --> 01:21:37.090
Make it tasty and then you don't have to chew on it, just swallow it whole.

344
01:21:39.090 --> 01:21:41.090
And that is suffering.

345
01:21:50.090 --> 01:21:53.090
So we really need a good, healthy diet.

346
01:21:58.090 --> 01:22:00.090
First Peter is permeated with that.

