350
01:22:22.090 --> 01:22:23.090
Into a living hope.

351
01:22:27.090 --> 01:22:29.090
Through the resurrection of Jesus Christ from the dead.

352
01:22:30.090 --> 01:22:34.090
And into an inheritance that will never perish, spoil, or fade.

353
01:22:44.090 --> 01:22:46.090
In heaven, it is kept for you.

354
01:22:53.090 --> 01:22:56.090
Who are shielded by God's power because you believe.

355
01:22:59.090 --> 01:23:00.090
