374
01:25:08.090 --> 01:25:11.090
Even if you have to endure some suffering for a little while.

375
01:25:13.090 --> 01:25:15.090
Your life on earth is short.

376
01:25:20.090 --> 01:25:24.090
When you talk about heaven, then this is just a very short time.

377
01:25:26.090 --> 01:25:28.090
Compared to eternity.

378
01:25:35.090 --> 01:25:39.090
It is a short blip on a very long eternal timeline.

