396
01:28:44.090 --> 01:28:48.090
And also persecution for believers and for the churches throughout the centuries as well.

397
01:28:50.090 --> 01:28:52.090
Right from the very beginning of the church.

398
01:28:56.090 --> 01:28:59.090
Believers were persecuted and even killed for their faith.

399
01:29:05.090 --> 01:29:08.090
