401
01:29:22.090 --> 01:29:23.090
Every day of your life.

402
01:29:25.090 --> 01:29:27.090
And that is not a nonchalant Christianity.

403
01:29:31.090 --> 01:29:35.090
And that you come in too late to worship, Christianity.

404
01:29:35.090 --> 01:29:38.090
Because you have no fear of the Lord in your soul.

