01:33:02.090 --> 01:33:04.090
Israel at the moment also knows what it costs.

450
01:33:07.090 --> 01:33:08.090
What it costs to be steadfast.

451
01:33:24.090 --> 01:33:26.090
We can't do anything about it ourselves, but there is just suffering.

452
