01:35:29.090 --> 01:35:36.090
works together so that it will be shown that your faith is genuine and sincere.

472
01:35:41.090 --> 01:35:42.090
Yes, it's a vegetable, isn't it?

473
01:35:47.090 --> 01:35:57.090
